":"fish"},{"surface":"சீவும்","parts":[{"text":"சீவு","lemma":"சீவு","gloss":"scale"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"scaling"},{"surface":"பாண்","parts":[{"text":"பாண்","lemma":"பாண்","gloss":"bard"}],"gloss":"bard"},{"surface":"சேரி","parts":[{"text":"சேரி","lemma":"சேரி","gloss":"settlement"}],"gloss":"settlement"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாய்மொழி","parts":[{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"truth"},{"text":"மொழி","lemma":"மொழி","gloss":"word"}],"gloss":"truthful word"},{"surface":"தழும்பன்","parts":[{"text":"தழும்பன்","lemma":"தழும்பன்","gloss":"Taḻumpaṉ"}],"gloss":"Taḻumpaṉ"},{"surface":"ஊணூர்","parts":[{"text":"ஊணூர்","lemma":"ஊணூர்","gloss":"Ūṇūr"}],"gloss":"Ūṇūr"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குவளை","parts":[{"text":"குவளை","lemma":"குவளை","gloss":"blue water lily"}],"gloss":"blue water lily"},{"surface":"உண்கண்","parts":[{"text":"உண்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"beautiful"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"beautiful eyes"},{"surface":"இவளை","parts":[{"text":"இவள்","lemma":"இவள்","gloss":"this girl"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"accusative suffix"}],"gloss":"this girl"},{"surface":"தாயே","parts":[{"text":"தாய்","lemma":"தாய்","gloss":"mother"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"mother"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஈனாள்","parts":[{"text":"ஈன்","lemma":"ஈனுதல்","gloss":"give birth"},{"text":"ஆள்","lemma":"ஆள்","gloss":"she who (negative)"}],"gloss":"she who did not give birth"},{"surface":"ஆயினள்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினள்","lemma":"ஆயினள்","gloss":"she became"}],"gloss":"she became","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆயின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"ஆயின்","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if"},{"surface":"ஆனாது","parts":[{"text":"ஆனாது","lemma":"ஆனாது","gloss":"without ceasing"}],"gloss":"without ceasing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நிழல்தொறும்","parts":[{"text":"நிழல்","lemma":"நிழல்","gloss":"shade"},{"text":"தொறும்","lemma":"தொறும்","gloss":"every"}],"gloss":"in every shade"},{"surface":"நெடுந்தேர்","parts":[{"text":"நெடுந்தேர்","lemma":"நெடுந்தேர்","gloss":"tall chariots"}],"gloss":"tall chariots","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நிற்ப","parts":[{"text":"நில்","lemma":"நிற்றல்","gloss":"stand"},{"text":"ப","lemma":"ப","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to stand"},{"surface":"வயின்தொறும்","parts":[{"text":"வயின்","lemma":"வயின்","gloss":"place"},{"text":"தொறும்","lemma":"தொறும்","gloss":"every"}],"gloss":"in every place"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செந்நுதல்","parts":[{"text":"செந்நுதல்","lemma":"செந்நுதல்","gloss":"red forehead"}],"gloss":"red forehead","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephants"},{"surface":"பிணிப்ப","parts":[{"text":"பிணிப்ப","lemma":"பிணிப்ப","gloss":"to tie"}],"gloss":"to tie","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வருந்தல","parts":[{"text":"வருந்தல","lemma":"வருந்தல","gloss":"will suffer"}],"gloss":"will suffer","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மன்","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"எம்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"யாம்","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"பெருந்துறை","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்துறை","lemma":"பெருந்துறை","gloss":"great ghat"}],"gloss":"great ghat","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மரனே","parts":[{"text":"மரனே","lemma":"மரனே","gloss":"trees"}],"gloss":"trees","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"White paddy reapers, fearing the drum, / sweet honey held in the node of palmyra leaf-sheaths dispersing, / toddy-filtering sickle, small and few / fish scaling bard settlement, / of truthful Taḻumpaṉ's Ūṇūr like, / blue lily beautiful-eyed this girl's mother, / if she had not given birth, without ceasing, / in every shade tall chariots standing, in every place / red-foreheaded elephants being tied, / would suffer indeed, our great ghat's trees!","translation":"The reapers of white paddy fear the sound of the drum, causing the sweet honey stored in the palmyra leaf-sheaths to scatter. In the bards' settlement, they filter toddy with sickles and scale small fish. Like the town of Ūṇūr belonging to the truthful chieftain Taḻumpaṉ, this girl has beautiful eyes like blue water lilies. If only her mother had not given birth to her! Now, without end, tall chariots will stand in every shade, and elephants with red foreheads will be tied in every spot, causing the trees of our great riverbank to suffer.","modern":"வெண்ணெல் அறுவடை செய்பவர்கள் முழக்கும் தண்ணுமைப் பறையின் ஒலிக்கு அஞ்சி, பனைமடலின் கணுக்களில் உள்ள தேன்கூடுகளிலிருந்து இனிமையான தேன் சிதறி ஓடுகிறது. கள் வடிக்கப் பயன்படும் அரிவாளும், சிறிய மீன்களைச் சீவிச் சுத்தம் செய்யும் பாணர்களின் சேரியும் கொண்ட, வாய்மை பேசும் தழும்பன் என்பவனுடைய ஊணூர் போன்றது இவளது ஊர். குவளை மலர் போன்ற மை தீட்டிய கண்களை உடைய இவளை, இவளது தாய் பெற்றெடுக்காமல் இருந்திருக்கலாம். அவ்வாறு பெற்றெடுக்காமல் இருந்திருந்தால், இடைவிடாது நிழல் உள்ள இடங்களிலெல்லாம் நெடிய தேர்கள் வந்து நிற்பதும், இடங்கள்தோறும் செந்நிற நெற்றியைக் கொண்ட யானைகளைக் கட்டுவதும் நிகழாது; எமது பெரிய ஆற்றங்கரைத் துறையில் உள்ள மரங்களும் துன்புறாமல் இருந்திருக்கும்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Makaṭpāṟ Kāñci theme, where a girl's family refuses to give her in marriage to powerful kings, leading to war. The speaker, observing the arrival of rival armies, laments the girl's beauty. Her home, Ūṇūr, is described as a fertile place where bards scale fish and filter toddy, and where reapers' drums scare away honeybees. The girl has eyes as beautiful as blue water lilies. Because of her, kings have brought their armies; their tall chariots fill every shade and their war elephants are tied to every tree. The speaker wishes her mother had never given birth to her, so that the trees of their beautiful riverbank would not have to suffer from being used to tie these destructive war elephants.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.53],[1.53,2.3],[2.3,2.6],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.1],[3.1,4.19],[4.19,4.5],[4.5,5.15],[5.3,5.9],[5.9,6.2],[6.2,6.5],[6.5,6.7],[6.7,8.1],[8.1,8.3],[8.3,8.6],[8.6,9.2],[9.2,9.9],[9.9,10.2],[10.2,10.7],[10.7,10.9],[11.5,12.1],[12.45,12.8],[12.8,13.1],[13.1,13.4],[13.4,14.6],[14.6,15.1],[15.1,15.2],[15.2,16.0],[16.68,17.38],[17.38,17.68],[17.68,18.03],[18.03,18.08],[18.08,18.18],[18.18,19.68],[19.68,20.18],[20.18,20.38]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.71],[1.71,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.6],[3.6,3.8],[3.8,4.97],[4.97,5.3],[5.3,6.05],[6.2,6.5],[6.5,6.8],[6.8,7.2],[7.2,7.4],[7.4,8.9],[8.9,9.0],[9.0,9.4],[9.4,9.4],[9.4,10.8],[10.8,11.1],[11.1,11.6],[11.6,11.8],[12.2,12.6],[13.09,13.7],[13.7,14.1],[14.1,14.3],[14.3,15.5],[15.5,16.0],[16.0,16.1],[16.1,17.0],[17.76,18.46],[18.46,18.86],[18.86,19.36],[19.36,20.36],[20.36,20.53],[20.65,20.76],[20.76,21.36],[21.36,21.56]]},"sync":[[["வெண்ணெல்","white paddy"]],[["அரிஞர்","reapers"]],[["தண்ணுமை","drum"]],[["வெரீஇ","having feared"]],[["கண்மடல்","palmyra leaf-sheath"]],[["கொண்ட","which held"]],[["தீந்தேன்","sweet honey"]],[["இரிய","to disperse"]],[["கள்","toddy"],["அரிக்கும்","filtering"]],[["குயம்","sickle"]],[["சிறுசின்","small and few"]],[["மீன்","fish"]],[["சீவும்","scaling"]],[["பாண்","bard"]],[["சேரி","settlement"]],[["வாய்மொழி","truthful word"]],[["தழும்பன்","Taḻumpaṉ"]],[["ஊணூர்","Ūṇūr"]],[["அன்ன","like"]],[["குவளை","blue water lily"]],[["உண்கண்","beautiful eyes"]],[["இவளை","this girl"],["தாயே","mother"]],[["தாயே","mother"]],[["ஈனாள்","she who did not give birth"]],[["ஈனாள்","she who did not give birth"],["ஆயினள்","she became"]],[["ஆயின்","if"]],[["ஆனாது","without ceasing"]],[["நிழல்தொறும்","in every shade"]],[["நெடுந்தேர்","tall chariots"]],[["நிற்ப","to stand"]],[["வயின்தொறும்","in every place"]],[["செந்நுதல்","red forehead"]],[["யானை","elephants"]],[["பிணிப்ப","to tie"]],[["வருந்தல","will suffer"]],[["மன்","indeed"]],[["எம்","our"]],[["பெருந்துறை","great ghat"]],[["மரனே","trees"